## Attribution Requirements

While this software is MIT licensed and free to use, we kindly ask that you:

1. **Keep the original author attribution** in your README or documentation
2. **Link back to the original repository**: https://github.com/mawlid1431/ROAMI
3. **Credit Mowlid Haibe** as the original creator
4. **Star the repository** if you find it useful ⭐

Example attribution:

```markdown
## Credits

This project is based on [ROAMI](https://github.com/mawlid1431/ROAMI) 
created by [Mowlid Haibe](https://github.com/mawlid1431).
```

